        "PMC4145285::chunk::002::discussion::f8c841f9e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The typical as-cast AlCoCrFeNi2.1 lamellar spacing is on the micron scale.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed effect requires preservation of the two-phase eutectic FCC/B2 structure.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::000::abstract::c334ecd44f",
        "PMC4145285::chunk::002::discussion::f8c841f9e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing lamellar spacing to the submicron scale increases the density of coherent phase interfaces.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refined lamellae and their interfaces more effectively impede dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "More effective obstruction of dislocation motion increases strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refinement produces more uniformly distributed coherent interfaces that facilitate plastic deformation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interface-facilitated plastic deformation increases ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Directional solidification will increase yield strength by approximately 10–20% relative to a conventionally cast EHEA.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Directional solidification will increase fracture strain by approximately 10–20% relative to a conventionally cast EHEA.",
